[00:10.60]We are Jehovah’s army,
[00:14.76]Under Christ, his Son.
[00:19.20]Though we’re opposed by Satan,
[00:23.74]We are marching as one.
[00:28.28]We keep serving faithfully,
[00:32.84]Preaching far and near;
[00:37.44]We remain determined
[00:41.86]With no hint of fear.
[00:46.23](Chorus)
[00:46.38]We are Jehovah’s army;
[00:50.90]With his Christ we’re one,
[00:55.08]Joyfully declaring,
[01:00.54]“God’s rule has begun.”
[01:16.18]We are Jehovah’s servants,
[01:20.14]Searching for his sheep,
[01:24.92]Those who are lost and scattered,
[01:29.50]Those who sigh and who weep.
[01:33.98]These we try to find and feed
[01:37.87]With repeated calls;
[01:43.04]These we keep inviting
[01:46.74]To our Kingdom Halls.
[01:51.80](Chorus)
[01:51.95]We are Jehovah’s army;
[01:56.13]With his Christ we’re one,
[02:01.19]Joyfully declaring,
[02:05.62]“God’s rule has begun.”
[02:09.94]We are Jehovah’s army,
[02:12.96]Under Christ’s command,
[02:28.37]Fully equipped for battle,
[02:32.43]Each one firmly will stand.
[02:37.41]Cautious though we need to be,
[02:41.90]Upright we remain.
[02:46.38]In the face of danger,
[02:50.92]Truth we will maintain.
[02:55.29](Chorus)
[02:55.44]We are Jehovah’s army;
[02:59.94]With his Christ we’re one,
[03:04.52]Joyfully declaring,
[03:09.08]“God’s rule has begun.”
